      },
      "message": "fix(build): serde_json float_roundtrip so floats survive the project file\n\nWithout the feature an off-round float written as -14.966666666666667\nread back one ulp off (-14.966666666666669). Stamps hash stock and part\nfloats, so ops read Stale after every save and load, and mesh vertices\ndrifted. Enable float_roundtrip in the workspace dependency (every crate\ntakes serde_json from the workspace).\n\nPinned by float_roundtrip: off_round_stock_placement_and_contour_survive_save_and_load,\nimported_mesh_vertices_are_bit_identical_after_save_and_load.\n\nChangelog: Floats now round-trip exactly through the project file; ops no longer go Stale after save and load.\n\nFixes #169\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
